;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Erika-chan<STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> left the house early to prepare for the memorial service.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The rest of us gathered around the breakfast table.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サクラ写真.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "C" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> showed me a photo of </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> from high school when I asked.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Her hairstyle was different from the one in the vision, but this was definitely the person I saw.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Aren't there any photos from middle school, or from after she grew up?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Hardly any photos of </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> are left. </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> hated her looks, so she hated having her picture taken, too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">She got bullied at school because of her looks..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Bullying, huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> muttered quietly.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">What happened in Megasawa started with the bullying of </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That's why </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> sympathized with it so deeply, but she still tried to stop the murder plan.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> were in the same grade, right? Couldn't you do something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Bullying isn't something you can fix that easily. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Of course, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and I were always on </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s side. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> told us not to have anything to do with her at school... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Said otherwise we'd end up in a bad spot too..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Of course. It was bad enough to make </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> consider even murder for </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s sake.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's become a social problem, so I can imagine it can't be solved easily.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="9">you know about Droga, don't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Wha...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had suddenly started asking questions that went right to the heart of it.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Y-yeah, I k-k-know it... It's a drug that was made in this settlement..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Is the raw material cherry roots?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"H-how do you know that much...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was visibly shaken.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s hypothesis seemed to have been right.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Is it really not still being made today?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Isn't the Niimura main house's cherry tree dying because its roots are being damaged and harvested?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> seemed to be checking her hypothesis against the answers right here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Or she was trying to see whether </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would lie here.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Impressive, genius girl... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">It's true, we do make Droga. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">This many curse-killings keep happening. You need it to protect yourself, don't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"If it was made for self-defense, then naturally everyone in the settlement knows about it, right?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah, that's right... But </STYLE>Mom<STYLE ID="4">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> don't know. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Partly because they were still kids, and </STYLE>Mom<STYLE ID="4"> would never allow anyone to make Droga..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"............?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　What are you talking about...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> seemed to find the talk hard to follow...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"May I check with </STYLE>Erika-chan<STYLE ID="9"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">All right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Mom<STYLE ID="4">'s going to be angry..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">That probably wasn't the answer of someone who was lying.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even so, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s gaze was awfully sharp.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... does Droga have anything to do with this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"No, I don't think it's directly connected to the curse-killings, but I've got an idea why </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Niimura-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> made Droga, so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Even if the one in </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s vision was </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, do you have proof he was making Droga?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"I don't. It's an assumption, after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Tch...! Yeah, okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Her own dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had been making Droga, and hearing that had put </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> in a pretty bad mood.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Your mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> often says it, doesn't she? That they were a husband and wife who were just alike."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"So what about it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Your mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> tried to commit murder to protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">In the same way, couldn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">your father</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> have tried to stop the bullying with Droga to protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, even if he wouldn't go as far as killing?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, what would you do? If </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> were being bullied and only violent means were left."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Geez... Fine, I get it! It's just an assumption anyway, right? Reason it out however you want..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It seemed </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was completely out of sorts.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even hypothetically, nobody would feel good hearing their own parents talked about like that.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, huh... Well, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">he</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> groveled a lot, but he was the type who valued </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="きずな">bonds</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, he used Droga to help her? Put that way, I can't say I don't buy it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">One for all, all for one."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"That motto's getting seriously </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="うさんくさ">fishy</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, too... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Fine, whatever. </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> was using Droga to protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, right? Then that makes sense."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"No, not using it. I think he got hurt when he was testing it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Probably while trying to show </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> what Droga could do at the secret base..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Haah... What a klutz </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> was... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">But is Droga really something you can use that easily?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"When we use it, the plan is to inject it into the muscle. Syringes are easy to buy online."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, is there a book or something that describes how to make Droga?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah, it's in this house's storehouse. </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> must have found it, gathered roots underground, and made Droga."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Is it something even </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, a middle schooler at the time, could make?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"It's not that hard a method. If you boil freshly dug roots in water, you get a liquid that separates into layers. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">One of those layers is Droga. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Boil off more of the water and you get solid crystals. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="13" RUBY="いぶ">Burning</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> it for smoke uses those, and while that works on lots of people at once, it puts them in a pretty intense high. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">If it stays a liquid, that side effect is kept down."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, you know a lot about it. Haven't you used it yourself, maybe?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Of course not. Nobody knows what side effects might show up, so using it is a last resort. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">The book covers those effects, too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"I see. Please go on."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"From the contents, it looks like it was written about 50 years ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I'd guess the Grand Witch of the time asked for research data in exchange for providing the cherry trees."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s hypothesis lined up with it almost exactly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There may have been an institution researching Droga that traded research results for the cherry trees.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Haruka's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> happened to find that text and ended up making Droga.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, now that we've come this far, please tell us. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="9">Who sent the Droga to Megasawa City?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Up to now, though his eyes had been darting around, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had answered smoothly, but now his mouth stopped.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">He looked down and stayed silent, as if lost in thought.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\The_Covert.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry, I really don't know about that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">To begin with, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> would never tell even me that she was sending Droga."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Then who do you think sent it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mmm... who could it be... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> confiding something like that in anyone... I can't even think who that would be..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Then what do you think the Droga was sent for?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"What for...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　To make </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> kill elementary school kids no matter what, right?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\怖い効果音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\五島の眼光.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s manner was an interrogation by now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was truly trying to use the </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="ささい">tiniest</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> contradictions to dig out </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s lies.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In the same way, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> must have understood what </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s questions were after.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Unrecognizable as the rowdy, endlessly cheerful little kid she usually is, at times like this </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has a gaze that is abnormally intimidating.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is really innocent, he'll choose his words so as not to look suspicious.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is not innocent, he'll choose his words so as not to look suspicious.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Either way, the behavior is the same. Right now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is in a really tough spot.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎うつむき逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"If you're going to keep quiet, you don't have to say anything more."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I'm sorry..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Thank you for the meal! I'll go get ready for the thirteenth-year memorial service, then!" [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> left the living room without eating even a tenth of her usual amount.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> heaved a big sigh.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Don't you think </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> went too far just now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah... she was a little scary..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Hey, is </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> actually like that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, faced with a look on </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s face she had never seen before, was </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="おび">frightened</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"No, that's not it. She really wants to solve the curse-killings, so she just got serious."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Oh... right, yeah!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物2,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―But I know.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">When I'd only just met her, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would sometimes let that kind of look show.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The gloomy </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> who couldn't trust people and shut herself away in her own world.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">With someone she can't trust, she probably takes that attitude without holding back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Since she kept that attitude to the very end, it means </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s guess has gotten pretty close to certainty.</STYLE>
